# Personal Configuration (gitignored)

This file is gitignored — it contains user-specific bindings that override
project-level bindings in CLAUDE.md. Each user on the project creates their own.

## Capability Binding Overrides

These override project-level bindings in CLAUDE.md for this user only.

### messaging
Prefer Slack DM over Telegram for this project:
- **blocking:** `mcp__slack__post_message(channel: "D12345", text: <message>)` — DM to self
- **info:** print to terminal (don't interrupt for status updates)

### session-logging
Use file-based logging instead of the project's session-logging MCP server:
- **tool:** Append to `tmp/session-log.md` using the Write tool
- **format:** `[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] [CATEGORY] Description`

## Browser Testing Credentials
- **login:** admin@example.com / devpassword123

## Autonomy Preferences
- Don't ask before sending notifications — just send them
- Use `blocking` messaging only when genuinely blocked on a decision
- Use `info` messaging for all status updates
